<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms buy 40,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms buy 40,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms bought 40,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for June shipment, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We bought a total of 27,000 tonnes dark northern spring wheat and 13,000 tonnes western white wheat Friday night,&quot; an executive in one of the flour mills which bought wheat told Reuters.</p>
<p>The executive declined to divulge the prices at which the firms bought the wheat.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
